      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "送到目白阿尔丹面前的，\n是光看着就会让人流汗，宛如岩浆般\n灼热的料理！不过她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a09e26cf604b89c9f140cc772756a0f7d125a6e16668a7f61ae458c4a84974",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
